// The warm shallows (V2-10 (f)): the coral reefs and seagrass beds of the Indo-Pacific and the
// Caribbean, their fish, sharks, turtles and sea cows; and the mangroves' animals, on the tidal
// mud and in the trees (the land half of the mangrove's place). Densities of the sea's animals are
